    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1448">

                <pb facs="1108" n="992" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg992"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.115/145.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Special Agent Carothers to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Aguascalientes</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-03-07">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 7, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Have held up payment of tax in Guadalajara until some agreement is reached.
                    Authorities claim it is State tax and not forced loan. Will report results
                    later.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Carothers.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
